  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the truck. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2019-2024 Ford Ranger models with a 5ft bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nPerfect Fitment: The YITAMOTOR FRP hard tri-fold tonneau cover is designed to fit for Ford Ranger 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 models with a 5ft bed; This truck bed cover offers a seamless fit, ensuring your truck maintains its sleek appearance\nEasy Installation: No need for drilling; these truck tonneau covers can be securely fastened to the truck bed using just six sturdy clamps; It's a tunnel cover for trucks designed with user convenience in mind\nCargo Storage Securing: Added security for your truck bed contents, deterring theft and protecting items.\nRobust Construction: Crafted from Fiberglass Reinforced Polymer (FRP) and featuring an internal PP honeycomb structure, this bed cover provides excellent durability; It's resistant to wear and scratches, and can handle a maximum weight of 450LB, making it a reliable choice among truck tonneau covers\nSuperior Protection: Our truck bed cover safeguards your cargo against rain, snow, dust, and theft; It also protects your privacy, locking securely when the tailgate is closed; It's a tonneau cover built for all weather conditions and security",
